#### unlinked, starting

### GET /api/status  (auth: bearer)
< 200
< Content-Type: application/json
{"connected":false,"full_text_search":true,"pairing":{"linked":false},"read_allowlist":[],"read_only":false,"send_allowlist":[],"session":{"state":"starting","since":"<NOW>","needs_action":false}}

### GET /api/qr  (auth: bearer)
< 200
< Content-Type: application/json
{"linked":false}

### GET /api/qr?format=png  (auth: bearer)
< 404
< Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
< X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
No QR code to show (already linked, or not generated yet)

### POST /api/logout  (auth: bearer)
> {"confirm":true}
< 500
< Content-Type: application/json
{"success":false,"message":"Not linked"}

### POST /api/connection/reconnect  (auth: bearer)
< 409
< Content-Type: application/json
{"success":false,"message":"not linked to WhatsApp: pair the device first (GET /api/qr); there is no session to reconnect"}

