#### session states, driven by whatsmeow events

#### after *events.Connected

### GET /api/status  (auth: bearer)
< 200
< Content-Type: application/json
{"connected":false,"full_text_search":true,"jid":"79990000001@s.whatsapp.net","pairing":{"linked":true},"read_allowlist":[],"read_only":false,"send_allowlist":[],"session":{"state":"connected","since":"<NOW>","needs_action":false}}

#### after *events.Disconnected

### GET /api/status  (auth: bearer)
< 200
< Content-Type: application/json
{"connected":false,"full_text_search":true,"jid":"79990000001@s.whatsapp.net","pairing":{"linked":true},"read_allowlist":[],"read_only":false,"send_allowlist":[],"session":{"state":"disconnected","reason":"connection lost, reconnecting","since":"<NOW>","needs_action":false}}

#### after *events.LoggedOut

### GET /api/status  (auth: bearer)
< 200
< Content-Type: application/json
{"connected":false,"full_text_search":true,"jid":"79990000001@s.whatsapp.net","pairing":{"linked":true},"read_allowlist":[],"read_only":false,"send_allowlist":[],"session":{"state":"logged_out","reason":"the device was logged out (removed from Linked devices or expired); restart the bridge and scan the QR code (401: logged out from another device)","since":"<NOW>","needs_action":true}}

#### after *events.LoggedOut

### GET /api/status  (auth: bearer)
< 200
< Content-Type: application/json
{"connected":false,"full_text_search":true,"jid":"79990000001@s.whatsapp.net","pairing":{"linked":true},"read_allowlist":[],"read_only":false,"send_allowlist":[],"session":{"state":"logged_out","reason":"the device was logged out (removed from Linked devices or expired); restart the bridge and scan the QR code","since":"<NOW>","needs_action":true}}

#### after *events.StreamReplaced

### GET /api/status  (auth: bearer)
< 200
< Content-Type: application/json
{"connected":false,"full_text_search":true,"jid":"79990000001@s.whatsapp.net","pairing":{"linked":true},"read_allowlist":[],"read_only":false,"send_allowlist":[],"session":{"state":"stream_replaced","reason":"another client connected with this session (is a second bridge running?); stop it and restart this bridge","since":"<NOW>","needs_action":true}}

