### GET /api/status  (auth: bearer)
< 200
< Content-Type: application/json
{"connected":false,"full_text_search":true,"jid":"79990000001@s.whatsapp.net","pairing":{"linked":true},"read_allowlist":[],"read_only":false,"send_allowlist":[],"session":{"state":"temporary_ban","reason":"You've been temporarily banned: 101: you sent too many messages to people who don't have you in their address books. The ban expires in 2h0m0s","since":"<NOW>","needs_action":true}}

