#### reconnect

### POST /api/connection/reconnect  (auth: bearer)
< 500
< Content-Type: application/json
{"success":false,"message":"Reconnect failed: reconnect disabled in contract tests"}

### GET /api/status  (auth: bearer)
< 200
< Content-Type: application/json
{"connected":false,"full_text_search":true,"jid":"79990000001@s.whatsapp.net","last_reconnect":"2025-06-01T12:00:00Z","pairing":{"linked":true},"read_allowlist":[],"read_only":false,"send_allowlist":[],"session":{"state":"connect_failure","reason":"503: unknown error try later","since":"<NOW>","needs_action":true}}

### POST /api/connection/reconnect  (auth: bearer)
< 429
< Content-Type: application/json
< Retry-After: 20
{"success":false,"message":"reconnected less than 30s ago; try again in 20s"}

### POST /api/connection/reconnect  (auth: bearer)
< 500
< Content-Type: application/json
{"success":false,"message":"Reconnect failed: reconnect disabled in contract tests"}

